<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Xi-kki Agents</title>
<meta name="description" content="AI agents for food-tech founders, by Xi-kki: RegReady, Zareb, Sabe, Panto, Sousy, Bingine and more.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,650&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f6f1e7;--surface:#fffdf8;--ink:#1d2a22;--muted:#5d6a61;--line:#e3dccd;--brand:#0f5c3a;--brand-ink:#fff;--soft:#e8f0e9}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#111814;--surface:#18221c;--ink:#eef3ee;--muted:#a3b0a7;--line:#2a372f;--brand:#4fbf86;--brand-ink:#0b1510;--soft:#1f2e25}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.55 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
.wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 16px 80px}
.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:40px}
.top a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500}
.top a:hover{color:var(--brand)}
.top nav{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
h1{font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,54px);line-height:1.05;margin:8px 0 12px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.lede{color:var(--muted);max-width:58ch;margin:0 0 40px}
h2{font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-size:26px;margin:44px 0 6px}
.sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:16px}
.card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:22px;transition:border-color .2s,transform .2s}
.card:hover{border-color:var(--brand);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.card.feature{grid-column:1/-1;background:var(--soft)}
.card h3{font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-size:23px;margin:10px 0 6px}
.card p{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--muted);flex:1}
.tag{align-self:flex-start;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--brand)}
.feature .tag{background:var(--surface)}
.tag.code{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted)}
.links{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
.links a{color:var(--brand);text-decoration:none}
.links a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.links a.gh{color:var(--muted)}
footer{margin-top:56px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
footer a{color:var(--brand);font-weight:600}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="wrap">
  <div class="top">
    <a href="/">← Xi-kki</a>
    <nav><a href="/builds/">Builds</a><a href="/video/">Video</a><a href="/writes/">Writes</a></nav>
  </div>

  <div class="eyebrow">By Xi-kki</div>
  <h1>AI agents for food-tech founders.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Agents that answer one hard question well: compliance, sourcing, kitchen stock, food waste. Need one built for your business? Message me.</p>

  <h2>Food-tech agents</h2>
  <p class="sub">Compliance, sourcing and kitchen operations.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card feature">
      <span class="tag">New · Live</span>
      <h3>RegReady</h3>
      <p>Your NAFDAC registration and export checklist in under a minute, tailored to your product and business size, with the official source behind every step.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="./regready/">Try RegReady →</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live</span>
      <h3>Zareb</h3>
      <p>Checks food product documents against EU and UK export rules and tells you what to fix.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://zareb.netlify.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a><a class="gh" href="https://github.com/xi-kki/zareb" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Code</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live</span>
      <h3>Sabe</h3>
      <p>Sourcing agent for African food-tech founders: find and compare suppliers fast.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://sabe-six.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a><a class="gh" href="https://github.com/xi-kki/sabe" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Code</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live</span>
      <h3>Panto</h3>
      <p>Sourcing and matchmaking agent that connects food-tech buyers with the right suppliers.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://panto-mu.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a><a class="gh" href="https://github.com/xi-kki/panto" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Code</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live</span>
      <h3>Sousy</h3>
      <p>Hands-free voice agent for commercial kitchen inventory. Talk, and stock updates itself.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://sousy.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a><a class="gh" href="https://github.com/xi-kki/sousy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Code</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live</span>
      <h3>Bingine</h3>
      <p>Offline AI food-waste tracker. Never let good food go bad.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://bingine.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a><a class="gh" href="https://github.com/xi-kki/bingine" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Code</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live · sign-up</span>
      <h3>Zamu</h3>
      <p>Snap a photo of a sick plant and get a diagnosis, treatment and care advice.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://zamu.base44.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live</span>
      <h3>FarmLinq</h3>
      <p>Farm-to-market logistics planner that cuts food waste at pickup.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://farmlinq.lovable.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Founder agents</h2>
  <p class="sub">Funding, research, negotiation and growth.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live on Telegram</span>
      <h3>Paiye</h3>
      <p>Career agent: remote job search, ATS resume checks, interview prep and AI chat.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://t.me/Paiye_Bot" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open @Paiye_Bot →</a><a class="gh" href="https://github.com/xi-kki/paiye-bot" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Code</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live</span>
      <h3>Lynx</h3>
      <p>Research engine that turns real problems into grounded, buildable product ideas.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://lynx-research-six.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag code">Code</span>
      <h3>Grantini</h3>
      <p>Grant research agent: paste a project URL or description, get matching grants and a plan.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://github.com/xi-kki/grantini" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View code →</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag code">Code</span>
      <h3>Kapitali</h3>
      <p>AI investor copilot with retrieval over your deal notes and market data.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://github.com/xi-kki/kapitali" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View code →</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live</span>
      <h3>Negotia8</h3>
      <p>Negotiation simulator with a 3D avatar that reacts, voice input and emotion feedback.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://negotia8.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a><a class="gh" href="https://github.com/xi-kki/Negotia8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Code</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live</span>
      <h3>Logos</h3>
      <p>Prompt optimisation agent. Write a small idea, get a product-ready prompt.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://logos-one-pied.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a><a class="gh" href="https://github.com/xi-kki/logos" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Code</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Agent infrastructure</h2>
  <p class="sub">Trust, payments and onboarding for agents on-chain.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live</span>
      <h3>VERIDD</h3>
      <p>On-chain reputation score for AI agents, built on 0G. Verify before you trust.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://veridd.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a><a class="gh" href="https://github.com/xi-kki/veridd" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Code</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag code">Code</span>
      <h3>Floe</h3>
      <p>Trustless escrow for AI agents on Sui, with on-chain verification and disputes.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://github.com/xi-kki/Floe" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View code →</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Live</span>
      <h3>Gaid3</h3>
      <p>A calm, practical agent that walks newcomers through Web3 step by step.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://gaid3.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open →</a><a class="gh" href="https://github.com/xi-kki/gaid3" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Code</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <span>Built by Xi-kki · <a href="https://github.com/xi-kki" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a></span>
    <a href="https://wa.me/2349066339975" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get a custom agent on WhatsApp →</a>
  </footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
